WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:05,380
Da Zhuang, why did you only attack Wu Xun?

2
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:08,880
Because he gave the order before the battle started

3
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:11,880
He is the captain, I want to defeat the core of the team first

4
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:14,180
your idea is good

5
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:15,680
But after finding that the other party was difficult to solve,

6
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,680
You should prioritize solving other people in front of you

7
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:18,680
Other people are important too

8
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:21,180
Can help core members gain a chance to win

9
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:24,040
Every member of Da Zhuang

10
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:26,040
They all gave full play to their own advantages

11
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:27,540
This is teamwork

12
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:29,920
And next time we face the enemy

13
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:32,420
Don't tell the other person your plans

14
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:37,540
Lin Lulu, why don’t you lose?
